    <!-- Dark minimal palette (v1.2.2): near-black background, charcoal
         cards, 1px borders, ONE muted slate-blue accent (#6e8cb0).
         No gradients, no gold. The old "green_*" names are kept so every
         layout / drawable / Kotlin reference keeps working — their values
         now map to the dark minimal system instead of green. -->
